> # Constrain thresholds to be equal across time points
> mood1 | t1
> mood2 | t1
> mood3 | t1
> mood4 | t1

You have not placed any constraints.  You must give them the same label (e.g., foo) to make them the same parameter:

mood1 | foo*t1
mood2 | foo*t1
mood3 | foo*t1
mood4 | foo*t1

