if someone encounters the same problem: In my case, I was able to solve it by writing the total effect differently. Instead of this:

total_ASB_g1 := c1.g1 + indirect_ASB_g1

I wrote it like this:

total_ASB_ANT_g1 := c.g1 + (a1.g1 * b1.g1).
