Subject: sam() producing different results depending on method of factor identification
Message-ID: <lNfiReOerzE.aTiNH2zCBAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/lNfiReOerzE/m/aTiNH2zCBAAJ>
